Backport of trilinos/Trilinos#15807 (commit caec09d3fa, "PyTrilinos2: Fix build
errors"), merged after 17.2.1. Drop on the next Trilinos release.

With ETI enabled, the generated Thyra_TpetraThyraWrappers.hpp and
Thyra_TpetraLinearOp.hpp only include the _decl headers, so binder (clang)
rejects the explicit instantiations in PyTrilinos2_Thyra_ETI.hpp with
"explicit instantiation of undefined function template".

